#. module: safety_datasheet
#: model:sds.sentences,name:safety_datasheet.sentence_containment_11
msgid ""
"If the product cannot be removed dry using a suction cleaner or made wet, make sure that staff\n"
"                responsible for sweeping it up dry wear appropriate individual protection equipment and that further dispersion\n"
"                of dust is prevented."
